2.3429397,48.8863662],[2.3429365,48.8863952],[2.342921,48.8863943],[2.3429197,48.8864041],[2.3429184,48.886414],[2.3429138,48.8864367],[2.3428093,48.8864305],[2.3428073,48.8864293],[2.342787,48.8864277],[2.3427837,48.8864427],[2.3427869,48.8864431],[2.3427838,48.886462],[2.3427763,48.8864623]]]},"basemapReplacement":{"tileset":"protomaps-20260911","featureIds":[35184395851813,35184598816152,35184598816153,35184598816154,35184598816155,35184598816156,35184598816157,35184598816158,35184598816159,35184598816165,35184598816167,35184598816168,35184598816169,35184598816170,35184598816171,35184598816172,35184598816173,35184598816174,35184598816175,35184598816176,35184598816177,35184598816178,35184598816179,35184598816180,35184598816181,35184598816182,35184598816183,35184598816184,35184598816185,35184598816186,35184598816187,35184598816188,35184598816189,35184598816190,35184598816191,35184598816192,35184598816193,35184598816194,35184598816195,35184598816196,35184598816197,35184598816198,35184598816199,35184598816200,35184598816201],"toleranceM":0.75,"sourceZoom":15},"osm":{"type":"way","id":23762981,"version":72,"timestamp":"2025-11-02T09:46:33Z","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/23762981"},"additionalOsm":[],"rightsStatus":"review-required","geometryStatus":"draft","attribution":"Open Landmarks; contains © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL-1.0","references":[{"title":"File:Le sacre coeur.jpg","author":"Tonchino","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Le_sacre_coeur.jpg","sourceSha1":"9fe7fdd167ad6ab2853c8752197b83bf21e42b0a","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"full south elevation, daylight"},{"title":"File:Basilica of the Sacred Heart of Montmartre, Paris (22119).jpg","author":"Aliva Sahoo","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Basilica_of_the_Sacred_Heart_of_Montmartre,_Paris_(22119).jpg","sourceSha1":"e68c80f246cf206a6375ea3ebd957d8d4f1df9f7","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"southwest domes and porch, daylight"},{"title":"File:Basilica of the Sacred Heart of Montmartre, Paris (33846).jpg","author":"Aliva Sahoo","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Basilica_of_the_Sacred_Heart_of_Montmartre,_Paris_(33846).jpg","sourceSha1":"256df95a66799bcc9ea25f396f82388ae0970262","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"drum openings, daylight"}],"aliases":[],"authors":["Open Landmarks contributors"],"artisticLicense":"CC-BY-4.0","spatialDataLicense":"ODbL-1.0","licenseScope":"CC BY applies to original artistic contributions only; ODbL applies to OSM-derived spatial data. Reference photographs retain their own licenses.","assistance":"AI-assisted architectural interpretation and procedural recipe authoring; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["Plan registration: every mass is built from, or centred on, the mapped OSM building:part polygons (outline, Greek-cross arms, four corner-dome towers, choir, ambulatory, apse, south porch, gable, equestrian plinths, turrets and campanile).","Mapped heights retained: 16 m perimeter body, 24 m arm walls with 33 m roof ridges, 33 m corner drums, 46 m corner domes with lanterns to 53 m, 73 m main dome with lantern cross to 83 m, 57/64 m campanile square stage and 84 m campanile top.","Main dome: drum 31-48.5 m rising behind the 33 m roof ridges (arcaded exterior colonnade of 16 bays, attic with 32 small arched windows), tall pointed ovoid dome springing at 48.45 m (r 9.9 m, 22 m semi-axis, stepped stone courses) reaching the mapped 70 m lantern base; slim colonnaded lantern with cross to the mapped 83 m. Drum/dome split inferred from the south-facade photograph.","Corner domes: octagonal drums (24-33 m) with paired arched windows under one archivolt, pointed ovoid coursed domes reaching the mapped 46 m, slim open lanterns and crosses to 53 m (OSM gives no roof:height; profile inferred from photographs).","Campanile: square shaft with corner buttresses and slit windows, three-arched belfry per face, parapet at 57 m, 12-bay arcaded drum, ovoid dome and lantern with cross reaching the mapped 84 m.","South facade: three tall vaulted arches (spring 6.4 m, crown ~8.8 m) filling the mapped porch plan between the two mapped 13 m end piers, which carry simplified equestrian statue masses (St Louis and Joan of Arc, patina), upper three-arched loggia, triangular gable with Christ niche aedicule and two domed turrets.","Arm roofs are low stone gables meeting at the crossing, the chevet steps up from eight radiating chapels with coursed domelets on the 16 m terrace, to the 24 m ambulatory terrace, to a windowed semicircular apse clerestory (to 28.6 m) under a coursed half-dome meeting the 33 m ridge; roofs are pale stone as on the building. Transept gable ends carry raking cornices and a traceried rose (moulded ring, spokes, hub, glass behind); the square bases of the corner towers carry the large arched niches with roses seen on the south front; small domed pinnacles ring the chevet on the ambulatory (count/spacing inferred, ~6 m).","Windows: round-arched with stone surrounds on the 16 m body and 24 m clerestory; bay spacing (~4.5-5 m) is inferred from photographs.","Omitted: sculpture, mosaics, bells, fine masonry, the terrace and steps. Statues are schematic horse-and-rider masses."],"source":{"url":"/objects/a0e12233949abaf06a8f432a855a5c22ab354e7a150f86425e080a7e1a24514f/source.blend.gz","bytes":686648,"sha256":"a0e12233949abaf06a8f432a855a5c22ab354e7a150f86425e080a7e1a24514f"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/64d884935424bd523ebea46219b4ee52aa97e2ba4f930657de223220fbef29fc/spatial-source.json","bytes":50299,"sha256":"64d884935424bd523ebea46219b4ee52aa97e2ba4f930657de223220fbef29fc"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/10613f7f23f0025409436e80c165b8c3056c58e635bba629bf3711c7f35aa76e/preview.webp","bytes":15516,"sha256":"10613f7f23f0025409436e80c165b8c3056c58e635bba629bf3711c7f35aa76e"},"revision":"22dbad885edc18ec0c843eff255ab40abaa45270305e30f640908538649d0460","publicationRevision":"00cde86c773d00ddb0b5d18acf33091f773dd9feb71eb019690fc345befb39dd","bounds":[2.3426601,48.8863615,2.3433943,48.8872306],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647","url":"/materials/f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647.json"},"metadata":"/assets/sacre-coeur/00cde86c773d00ddb0b5d18acf33091f773dd9feb71eb019690fc345befb39dd/asset.json","validation":"/assets/sacre-coeur/00cde86c773d00ddb0b5d18acf33091f773dd9feb71eb019690fc345befb39dd/validation.json"}